This is a template page for entering level rewards. See [[level rewards]] for the article version.

Please separate new lines with <code><nowiki><br></nowiki></code>. See [[Template:Level rewards]] for further documentation.

----
}}{{#if: {{{level|}}} | {{#ifeq: {{NAMESPACE}} | Template | [[Category:Level reward subpages]] }} }}<noinclude>
This is a row template used on [[Level rewards]] and [[:Category:Level reward subpages|the template subpages]].

{{Level rewards/documentation}}

[[Category:Table formatting templates]]
</noinclude>

{{Level rewards
 | level = 10
 | attributes = 7
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Story unlock.png|Personal story}} [[Personal story|Personal Story]] Unlocked {{#info:Your story awaits you! Check the upper-right corner of your screen for your next story step. Follow the green objective markers on your map, or quickly travel to your story step by opening your map and clicking a waypoint near the green marker.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Weapon Swap Button.png|Weapon swap}} [[Weapon swap|Weapon-Swapping]] Unlocked {{#info:Ready your second weapon set by arming it in your Hero panel. Press [~] to switch sets at any time. During battle, there's a nine-second cooldown between weapon swaps. During battle, warriors have a five-second cooldown between weapon swaps.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Raptor (overhead icon).png|Raptor}} [[Raptor]] Mount Unlocked {{#info:Unlocks the raptor mount for expansion-upgraded accounts (if you don't already have it). Starts the Raptor Mount Trial for Play for Free accounts.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 11
 | hero points = 5
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Utility unlock.png}} [[Utility skill|Utility Skill]] Slot Unlocked {{#info:You've unlocked your first utility skill slot. To equip a utility skill, click the arrow above your seventh skill slot and select a skill.}}<br>{{icon|re}}[[Legend|Legend Slot]]<br>{{icon|w}} {{icon|misc|Profession skill unlock.png}} [[Adrenaline]] Stage 2 Unlocked {{#info:You've unlocked stage two adrenaline. Your adrenaline bar can now fill an additional stage, which increases the effectiveness of your F1 skill.}}<br>{{icon|g}}{{#info:You've unlocked your second profession skill. F2 now heals you and your group. When this skill's not active, you slowly regenerate health.}}{{icon|en}}{{#info:You've unlocked your second profession skill. F2 now activates a different skill based on what's in your first utility skill slot.}}{{icon|r}}{{icon|m}} Profession Skill 2<br>{{icon|e}} Profession Skill 3 {{#info:You've unlocked your third profession skill: air attunement. Press F3 to switch to this attunement, which gives you more damage and control skills.}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Hero panel unlock.png}} [[Hero point|Hero Points]] {{#info:You can unlock skills by spending hero points in the training tab inside the hero panel. Hero points are earned by leveling up and by completing hero challenges found throughout Tyria.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 12
 | attributes = 10
 | items = {{item icon|Crude Salvage Kit}}<br>Choice of: {{item icon|Copper Doubloon}}, {{item icon|Garnet Pebble}}, or {{item icon|Malachite Pebble}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Stat increases.png|Upgrade component}}[[Upgrade component|Upgrades]] {{#info:Upgrade items improve your equipment's performance. Double-click an upgrade, and then click on a piece of gear with an unused upgrade slot to fuse the upgrade to the gear.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Salvaging unlock.png|Salvage}}[[Salvage|Salvaging]] {{#info:Some items you'll find will be salvagable. Use a salvage kit to break them down into crafting materials.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Crafting unlock.png|Crafting}}[[Crafting]] {{#info:Visit any city to find a Master Craftsman and learn a trade. Learning trades lets you craft weapons or armor, or even cook foods that temporarily boost stats.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 13
 | hero points = 5
 | info = {{icon|misc|Skill unlock.png|Condition}}[[Condition]]s {{#info:Conditions are negative status effects that players and creatures use. They include damage conditions (bleeding, burning, confusion, poison, and torment), movement-impairing conditions (cripple, chill, and immobilize), debilitation conditions (blind, weakness, vulnerability, and slow), and disabling conditions (fear and taunt). Certain skills can remove these effects from you and your allies.}}<br>{{icon|misc|AP.png|Daily (achievements)}}[[Daily (achievements)|Daily achievement]]s {{#info:Daily achievements are now unlocked. Complete them every day to earn bonuses and rewards. Open the Hero panel and click on the Achievements tab to see today's tasks.}}{{sic|The Daily section has been removed and replaced with Wizard's Vault}}<br>{{icon|misc|Laurel unlock.png|Laurel}}[[Laurel]]s {{#info:Laurels are a currency earned through daily log-in rewards. They can be spent at laurel merchants in major cities}}{{sic|Daily log-in rewards have been removed and replaced with Wizard's Vault}}
 | unlocks = {{icon|r}} All pet skills unlocked
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 14
 | attributes = 10
 | items = {{icon|g}}{{icon|re}}{{icon|w}} [[Mighty Chainmail Helm]]<br>{{icon|en}}{{icon|r}}{{icon|t}} [[Mighty Rawhide Mask]]<br>{{icon|e}}{{icon|m}}{{icon|n}} [[Mighty Apprentice Band]]
 | info = {{icon|misc|Skill unlock.png|Map completion}}[[Map completion]] {{#info:Map completion is another way to explore Tyria. Find all waypoints, points of interest, and vistas and complete all renown hearts and hero challenges in a map to earn rewards. Your completion progress is on your map.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Equipment unlock.png|Item#Rarity}}[[Item#Rarity|Masterwork Equipment]] {{#info:You can now equip masterwork gear. It's distinguished by its green text and improved stats.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 15
 | hero points = 5
 | items = {{icon|g}}{{icon|w}} Choice of : [[Mighty Iron Hammer of Air]], [[Mighty Iron Hammer of Ice]], or [[Mighty Iron Hammer of Frailty]]<br>{{icon|en}}{{icon|t}} Choice of: [[Mighty Iron Pistol of Frailty]], [[Mighty Iron Pistol of Ice]], or [[Mighty Iron Pistol of Air]]<br>{{icon|r}} Choice of: [[Mighty Soft Wood Longbow of Frailty]], [[Mighty Soft Wood Longbow of Ice]], [[Mighty Soft Wood Longbow of Air]]<br>{{icon|re}}{{icon|e}}{{icon|m}}{{icon|n}} Choice of: [[Mighty Soft Wood Staff of Air]], [[Mighty Soft Wood Staff of Frailty]], or [[Mighty Soft Wood Staff of Ice]]
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Utility unlock.png|Utility skill}} Utility Skill 2 Unlocked {{#info:You've unlocked your second utility skill. Equip it by clicking the up arrow above the eighth skill slot.}}<br>{{icon|g}}{{icon|en}}{{#info:You've unlocked your third profession skill. F3 now activates a new skill based on the skill equipped in your second utility slot.}}{{icon|m}} Profession Skill 3<br>{{icon|w}}{{icon|misc|Profession skill unlock.png}} [[Adrenaline]] Stage 3{{#info:You've unlocked the final stage of adrenaline. Your adrenaline bar can now fill an additional stage, which further increases the effecetiveness of your F1 skill.}}<br>{{icon|e}} Profession Skill 4 {{#info:You've unlocked your fourth profession skill: earth attunement. Press F4 to switch to this attunement, which gives you defensive and damage-over-time skills.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 16
 | attributes = 10
 | info = {{icon|misc|Guild unlock.png|Guild panel}}[[Guild panel]] {{#info:Guilds are a great way to make friends, explore Tyria with others, and gain access to bonuses. Press the [G] key or click the Guild button in the top left to find out more.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 17
 | items = {{icon|g}}{{icon|re}}{{icon|w}} Choice of: [[Mighty Worn Scale Pauldrons of Rata Sum]], [[Resilient Worn Scale Pauldrons of Rata Sum]], or [[Precise Worn Scale Pauldrons of Rata Sum]]<br>{{icon|en}}{{icon|r}}{{icon|t}} Choice of: [[Mighty Swindler Pauldrons of the Flame Legion]], [[Resilient Swindler Pauldrons of the Flame Legion]], or [[Precise Swindler Pauldrons of the Flame Legion]]<br>{{icon|e}}{{icon|n}}{{icon|m}} Choice of: [[Mighty Magician Mantle of the Lich]], [[Resilient Magician Mantle of the Lich]], or [[Precise Magician Mantle of the Lich]]
 | hero points = 5
 | info = {{icon|misc|Wardrobe unlock.png|Wardrobe}}[[Wardrobe]] {{#info:Acquiring nicer gear lets you collect skins to change your look as you progress. Open the Hero Panel and click on "Wardrobe" to swap the look of your equipment with skins you've collected.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Trading post unlock.png|Trading Post}}[[Trading Post]] {{#info:Trading posts are where merchants in major cities and throughout the world let you buy and sell items with other players. Go to your home city to give it a try.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 18
 | attributes = 10
 | items = Choice of: {{item icon|Pastel Lemon Dye}}, {{item icon|Rose Ice Dye}}, or {{item icon|Olive Tint Dye}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Dye unlock.png|Dye}}[[Dye]] {{#info:Customize your look with the dyes you've found in the Dyes section of your Hero Panel.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Asura Gate UI Icon.png|Asura gate}}[[Asura gate|Asura Gates]] {{#info:Asura gates let you quickly travel great distances. They're found throughout Tyria and in each major city.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 19
 | hero points = 6
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Profession skill unlock.png|Profession mechanic}} [[Profession mechanic|Profession Skill]] 4{{icon|en}}{{#info:You've unlocked your fourth profession skill. F4 now activates a different skill based on the ability in your third utility skill slot.}}{{icon|m}}{{#info:You've unlocked your fourth profession skill. F4 now destroys your clones and phantasms, allowing you to evade attacks for each one.}}{{icon|r}}{{#info:You've unlocked your fourth profession skill. F4 now switches between your two active pets.}} <br>{{icon|misc|Utility unlock.png|Utility skill}} [[Utility Skill]] 3 {{#info:You've unlocked your third utility skill. Equip it by clicking the arrow above your ninth skill slot.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 2
 | attributes = 7
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Skill unlock.png}} [[Skill bar#Weapon skills|Weapon Skill]] 2 {{#info:You've unlocked your second weapon skill. Press 2, or click your second hotkey, to unleash your new attack.}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Hero panel unlock.png}}[[Hero panel|Hero Panel]] {{#info:You've just received a weapon. Your Hero panel displays items from your inventory that you can equip, as well as your character's stats. Open it by clicking the icon in the top left or by pressing the [H] key.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Stat increases.png}}[[Attribute#Primary Attributes|Stat Increases]] {{#info:Your stats have improved! Power increases damage. Precision increases critical-hit chance. Toughness decreases incoming damage. Vitality increases health.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 20
 | attributes = 10
 | items = Choice of: {{item icon|Iron Ring (level 20)|Iron Ring}} (Condition Damage), {{item icon|Iron Ring (level 20)|Iron Ring}} (Power) or {{item icon|Iron Ring (level 20)|Iron Ring}} (Toughness)
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Story unlock.png|Personal story}} [[Personal story|Personal Story]] Chapter 2 {{#info:Chapter two of your personal story is now unlocked. Where will your story take you? There's only one way to find out!}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Equipment unlock.png|Ring}}[[Ring]]s {{#info:Rings are now easier to obtain. You can equip two rings at a time in your slots. Each ring can be different.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Jumping puzzle unlock.png|Jumping puzzle}}[[Jumping puzzle]]s {{#info:Jumping puzzles are jumping-based mini dungeons hidden throughout Tyria. Each jumping puzzle can be completed once a day to receive a reward chest.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 21
 | hero points = 6
 | unlocks = {{icon|misc|Hero panel unlock.png|Specialization}} [[Specialization]]s {{#info:Specializations are now unlocked. You can now spend hero points in the training tab on specializations. Once you begin training a specialization, you can set your active specialization in the build tab of the hero panel.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Hero panel unlock.png|Trait}} [[Trait]]s {{#info:Traits are now unlocked. Spending hero points in specializations earns you traits. Once unlocked, you can select them in the build tab for your specialization.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 22
 | attributes = 14
 | info = {{icon|misc|Combo unlock.png|Combo}}[[Combo|Combat Combinations]] {{#info:Create combos with other players' skills in combat. Some skills, like elementalist's Flame Wall, create fields that cause projectiles shot through them to deal additional burning damage. Check your skills to see your combo fields and combo finishers.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 23
 | items = {{icon|w}}{{icon|re}}{{icon|g}}{{icon|t}}{{icon|r}}{{icon|m}}{{icon|n}} Choice of: [[Hearty Iron Spear]], [[Ravaging Iron Spear]], or [[Strong Iron Spear]]<br>{{icon|en}} Choice of: [[Hearty Steam Speargun]], [[Ravaging Steam Speargun]], or [[Strong Steam Speargun]]<br>{{icon|e}} Choice of: [[Hearty Black Earth Trident]], [[Ravaging Black Earth Trident]], or [[Strong Black Earth Trident]]
 | hero points = 6
 | info = {{icon|misc|Bank.png|Account vault}} [[Account vault]] {{#info:Speak to bankers to see your Account Vault, where you can access your stored items with any character on your account.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 24
 | attributes = 14
 | items = Choice of: {{item icon|Carrion Amulet (level 24 reward)|Carrion Amulet}}, {{item icon|Hardy Amulet}}, or {{item icon|Mighty Amulet}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Equipment unlock.png}}[[Amulet]] {{#info:Amulets are now easier to obtain. You can equip one at a time in your amulet slot.}}<br>{{icon|misc|Bank.png|Wallet}}[[Wallet]] {{#info:The wallet is the place where all your earned currencies will be listed and tracked. Open your inventory panel and click on the wallet to view them.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 25
 | items = {{item icon|Backpack Straps of Preparation}}<br>{{item icon|Tiny Crafting Bag}}
 | hero points = 6
 | info = {{icon|misc|Exclamation mark unlock.png|Finisher}}[[Finisher]]s {{#info:In WvW, PvP, and sometimes PvE, you may have to finish off your enemy with a special move, Press F near a downed enemy to use a finisher. You can set your active finisher in the Finishers page on the Hero Panel.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 26
 | attributes = 15
 | items = {{item icon|Fine Essence of Luck|Essence of Luck}}<br>Choice of: {{item icon|Spinel Nugget}}, {{item icon|Peridot Nugget}} or {{item icon|Lapis Nugget}}
 | info = [[Magic Find]] {{#info:Some items, like Essence of Luck, give a magic find bonus. This attribute increases the chance for every character on your account to find high-quality loot on defeated foes.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
| level = 27
| items = {{icon|re}}{{icon|w}}{{icon|t}}{{icon|m}} Choice of: [[Honed Iron Sword of Chilling]], [[Honed Iron Sword of Corruption]], or [[Honed Iron Sword of Venom]]<br>{{icon|g}}{{icon|e}} Choice of: [[Honed Soft Wood Staff of Chilling]], [[Honed Soft Wood Staff of Earth]], or [[Honed Soft Wood Staff of Venom]]<br>{{icon|en}} Choice of: [[Honed Iron Rifle of Chilling]], [[Honed Iron Rifle of Earth]], or [[Honed Iron Rifle of Venom]]<br>{{icon|r}}{{icon|n}} Choice of: [[Honed Iron Axe of Debility]], [[Honed Iron Axe of Hobbling]], or [[Honed Iron Axe of Venom]]
| hero points = 8
| info = [[Currency Exchange]] {{#info:Did you know that you can exchange gold for gems and vice versa? Within the Black Lion Trading Post you can click on the Currency Exchange tab and swap your currencies!}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 28
 | attributes = 16
 | items = Choice of: {{item icon|Bowl of Strawberry Apple Compote}}, {{item icon|Strawberry Ghost}}, or {{item icon|Strawberry Tart}}
 | info = [[Food]] {{#info: To eat food, double-click it in your inventory. The chef discipline allows you to create food consumables. Consumable items boost attributes when eaten. Hover your mouse over a consumable to see what it does. Eat lots of food to unlock the All You Can Eat achievement.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 29
 | hero points = 8
 | info = [[Looking For Group|Looking for Group Tool]] {{#info:Find groups and group members by using the Looking for Group (LFG) tool. Click the Contacts and LFG button in the top left of your screen, and then click the Looking for Group icon on the pop-up box.}}
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 3
 | attributes = 7
 | items = {{item icon|Leather Bag (8 slots)|Leather Bag (8 slots)}}
 | info = {{icon|misc|Hero panel unlock.png}}[[Inventory]] {{#info:Things like bags, weapons and armor can be equipped. Open your inventory with the [I] key, and double-click on equipment to equip it.}}<br>{{icon|misc|PvP unlock.png}} [[Player versus Player|Player vs. Player]] {{#info:Take capture points, slay enemies, and earn rewards in a Player versus Player team battle. Click the crossed swords icon in the top left of your screen to enter PvP, which boosts your level to 80 for the duration of the fight.}}<br>Content Guide {{#info:The [[Content Guide]] points the way to nearby events, renown hearts, scouts, and unexplored areas. Check here if you're ever lost and looking for something to do!}} 
}}

{{Level rewards
 | level = 30
 | attributes = 16
 | unlocks = {{icon|story}} [[Personal story|Personal Story]] Chapter 3 {{#info:Chapter three of your personal story is now unlocked. Where will your story take you? There's only one way to find out!}}<br>{{icon|dungeon}} [[Ascalonian Catacombs (story)]] {{#info:If you and your friends are looking for a challenge, visit the Ascalonian Catacombs dungeon in the Plains of Ashford. Check your mail for map to the dungeon.}}
 | info = 
}}

