== Description ==
This template creates a table of the skills of a ranger's pet.

=== Usage ===
<pre>{{pet skills
| skillname =
| underwater =
}}</pre>

=== Parameters ===
; unnamed parameter 1
: Optional. The name of the pet. Defaults to PAGENAME.
; skillname
: Required. The F2 skill of this pet.
; underwater
: Optional. The F2 skill of this pet while underwater. For amphibious pets.

== Example ==
<pre>{{pet skills
| Juvenile Black Bear
| skillname = Enfeebling Roar
| underwater = Enfeebling Maul
}}</pre>

