==== Increase and decrease modifiers ====
Most modifiers increase or decrease a value by a percentage. ''duration increase'' can either provide an base increase or percentage increase, specify a percentage using a % character. Note that the different damage increase/reduced options, while they provide almost the same output, are required to internally specify their exact behaviour.

