{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|The Convoy|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=The Convoy|
'''The Convoy'''

''This card is blank.''
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|The Nameless Convoy|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=The Convoy|
'''[[Pact Commander|The Nameless Convoy]]'''

''The page swirls with all of the names you've been called before. [[Wayfinder]], Commander, [[Dragon champion|Champion]]... They all sting your eyes.''
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|I: The Forager|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=I: The Forager|
'''[[Uenno]], the Historian of the [[Astral Ward|Ward]]'''

The one who brings good news to the court; a careful observation, resting in a dimly lit room.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|II: The Minister Illuminate|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=II: The Minister Illuminate|
'''[[Akeem]], the Wizard of the [[Bastion of the Obscure|Obscure]]'''

The one who brings together our two worlds will die doing so; at the feet of a monstrous force, they will [[Lonely Tower Fractal|perish]].
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|III: The Mother Sovereign|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=III: The Mother Sovereign|
'''[[Waiting Sorrow]], the Eye of the Cosmos'''

Defeated and troubled, she will weep for herself before she weeps for us. Squinting through the [[Veil (lore)|veil]], attempting to see what may have once lived on the other side.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|IV: The Mirror|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=IV: The Mirror|
'''[[Isgarren]], the Wizard of the [[The Wizard's Tower|Tower]]'''

The sting of a strong gust, the distance he will fall. It is not as he remembered, being alive.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|V: The Weeping Mountain|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=V: The Weeping Mountain|
'''[[Frode]], the [[Warden of the Wizard's Court|Warden]] of the Ward'''

Under the blanket of heavy snow and burden, he may witness something horrible. Only after will he thrive.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|VI: The Broken Mortar|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=VI: The Broken Mortar|
'''[[Vanak Faithwalker]], the Keeper of [[Bastion of Strength|Strength]]'''

Changed minds weep over the ashes of [[Ascalon]]. Pools of blood, reflections into their own souls.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|VII: The Ballad|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=VII: The Ballad|
'''[[Zizel]], the Alchemist of the Ward'''

A bright light shines down the halls of discomfort. There is always a brighter side to things, even when the sky is dark with clouds.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|VIII: Forbearance|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=VIII: Forbearance|
'''[[Narcisse]], the Bloom of the Ward'''

Let her cry with you, for she has seen things in the [[Dream of Dreams|Dream]] that cannot be imagined.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|IX: The Stag|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=IX: The Stag|
'''[[Zojja]], the [[Elementalist]] of the Ward'''

''The words of this card swirl about, unsure what it should tell you. The only words you can make out are "empty", "flight" and "slumber".''
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|X: Satchel of Fate|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=X: Satchel of Fate|
'''[[Wizard's Ascent]]'''

A collection of ideas, spread across the table. Between wars and lovers, they almost always choose war.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XI: The Inevitable|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XI: The Inevitable|
'''[[Mabon]], the Wizard of Strength'''

''The beginning is not the end'', he once thought. He'd deserve it, if it happened. Atonement for the past.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XII: The Endless|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XII: The Endless|
'''[[Galrath the Undying]], the Tactician of the Ward'''

To he who glares toward the light, life will be a curse.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XIII: The Templar|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XIII: The Templar|
'''[[Livia]], the Sorceress of the Ward'''

She brings news of the shadows that we cannot see, eyes where ours are blind.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XIV: Patience|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XIV: Patience|
'''[[Vass]], the Wizard of the [[Bastion of the Natural|Natural]]'''

The one who watched the lands while the [[Elder Dragon|elder beasts]] brought havoc; she coddled a single bud.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XV: The Fiend|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XV: The Fiend|
'''[[Arina]], the Outrider of the Ward'''

The lady would look upon the [[Nayos|other world]] and see opportunity.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XVI: The Tower of Secrets|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XVI: The Tower of Secrets|
'''[[The Wizard's Tower]]'''

It reaches for his grasp, wounded and fractured.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XVII: The Cosmos|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XVII: The Cosmos|
'''[[Dagda]], the Wizard of the [[Bastion of the Celestial|Celestial]]'''

She weeps for what she left behind. She weeps for what she's afraid to lose.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XVIII: Twilight|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XVIII: Twilight|
'''[[Gladium (Astral Ward)|Gladium]], the Guide of the Ward'''

What she lost would be gained in other ways.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XIX: Sunrise|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XIX: Sunrise|
'''[[R'tchikk]], the Soul of the Ward'''

Curiosity can be a blessing.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XX: The Young Dragon|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XX: The Young Dragon|
'''[[Lyhr]], the Wizard of [[Bastion of Balance|Balance]]'''

Something precious rests just out of view; a flicker that you cannot recognize. Feelings that you cannot process. He stares back, but his face is sad and more knowing than yours.
}}
}}{{#if:{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|XXI: The Eye|y}}{{#ifeq:{{{1|}}}|full deck|y}}<noinclude>y</noinclude>
|{{Book text|title=XXI: The Eye|
'''[[Amnytas]]'''

It sent ripples over the land, like the surface of a lake; eventually the water would be still, and they'd see right to the bottom.
}}}}<noinclude>

