== Description ==
<pre style="width: 50%;">
{{Trailer|<image type>|<trailer name>}}
</pre>

This template is used to tag images from the Guild Wars 2 trailers, as well as add the proper licenses. It automatically categorizes tagged images into [[:Category:ArenaNet images]] or the appropriate sub category, as well as into into [[:Category:Trailers]].

=== Parameters ===
;1 ''(unnamed parameter)''
: Optional. Image type. Possible values:
:* <code>screenshot</code> : [[:Category:Screenshots]]
:* <code>icon</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet icons]]
:* <code>render</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet renders]]
:* <code>concept art</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet concept art]]
;2 ''(unnamed parameter)''
: Trailer name. Possible values:
:* <code>guild wars 2 teaser trailer</code> : [[:Category:August 2009 trailer]]
:* <code>the races of tyria trailer</code> : [[:Category:December 2009 trailer]]
:* <code>arenanet's mmo manifesto</code> : [[:Category:August 2010 trailer]]

[[Category:License templates]]
</noinclude>

