== Description ==
<pre style="width: 50%;">
{{Website image|<image type>}}
</pre>

This template is used to tag images from the Guild Wars 2 website, as well as add the proper licenses. It automatically categorizes tagged images into [[:Category:ArenaNet images]] or the appropriate sub category.

=== Parameters ===
;1 ''(unnamed parameter)''
: Optional. Image type. Possible values:
:* <code>screenshot</code> : [[:Category:Website screenshots]]
:* <code>icon</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet icons]]
:* <code>render</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet renders]]
:* <code>concept art</code> : [[:Category:ArenaNet concept art]]

[[Category:License templates]]
</noinclude>

